{"id":"f32c7d95792dcee2","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-CT-conservative.md","title":"CT减对PA的算术保守性","display":"thm-CT-conservative — CT减对PA的算术保守性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-CT-conservative","aliases":["91-thm-CT-conservative","91-thm-CT-conservative-extension","91-thm-compositional-conservative"],"display":"thm-CT-conservative — CT减对PA的算术保守性","depends_on":["[[91-df-CT]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-CT-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-CT-conservative</span><span>91-thm-CT-conservative-extension</span><span>91-thm-compositional-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-CT-conservative — CT减对PA的算术保守性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e1e503ea918b41a\" href=\"?note=4e1e503ea918b41a\" title=\"91-df-CT\">91-df-CT</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-CT-conservative-—-$\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$-对-PA-的算术保守性\">thm-CT-conservative — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 对 PA 的算术保守性</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> (PA 加组合真理公理，但不加含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的全归纳)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano 算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (算术句子集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}CT\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\to\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}CT\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\to\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>标准保守性定理针对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span>：组合公理提供统一满足类的局部\n行为，却没有含真理谓词的全归纳。证明可用模型论扩张或证明消去完成。</p>\n<p>本书的完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span> 定义为\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}+\\operatorname{IND}(\\mathcal L_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}+\\operatorname{IND}(\\mathcal L_T)\\)</span>；该理论可建立 PA\n证明的全局真性并证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>，所以不能把\n上式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 直接替换为完整 CT。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-CT-conservative-—-$\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$-对-PA-的算术保守性","text":"thm-CT-conservative — $\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$ 对 PA 的算术保守性","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-CT","status":"resolved","id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-CT]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":